#: graphs_new.php:940
msgid ""
"Error in Data Query.  This could be due to the following: File Permissions, "
"or a missing or improperly formatted Data Query XML file."
msgstr ""
"Fel i datafrågan. Det kan bero på filbehörigheterna eller på att datafrågans"
" XML-fil saknas eller har fel format."

#: host.php:162
msgid "Device Debugging Enabled for Device."
msgstr "Enhetsfelsökning aktiverad för enheten."

#: host.php:1654 host.php:1657 host.php:1802
msgid "Service Check"
msgstr "Tjänstekontroll"

#: host.php:1757
msgid "The name by which this Device will be referred to."
msgstr "Namnet som används för att identifiera enheten."

#: host.php:1769
msgid ""
"The internal database ID for this Device.  Useful when performing automation"
" or debugging."
msgstr ""
"Enhetens interna databas-ID. Användbart vid automatisering eller felsökning."

#: host.php:1811
msgid "The amount of time that this Device has been in its current state."
msgstr "Hur länge enheten har haft sin aktuella status."

#: host.php:1823
msgid "The amount of time it takes to collect data from this Device."
msgstr "Tiden det tar att samla in data från enheten."

#: host.php:1841
msgid ""
"The availability percentage based upon ping results since the counters were "
"cleared for this Device."
msgstr ""
"Tillgänglighet i procent utifrån pingresultaten sedan enhetens räknare "
"nollställdes."

#: host_templates.php:944
msgid ""
"The Class of this Device Template.  The Class Name should be representative "
"of it's function."
msgstr "Enhetsmallens klass. Klassnamnet bör beskriva dess funktion."
